ROOT     EQU   1100
K        EQU   1050
         ORIG  3000
START    LDX   K           T1. Initialize.
         ENT1  ROOT        P ← pointer to root of trie.
2H       SLAX  1           T2. Branch.
         STA   *+1(2:2)    Extract next character, k.
         ENT2  0,1         Q ← P + k.
         LD1N  0,2(0:2)    P ← LINK(Q).
         J1P   2B          T3. Advance. To T2 if P is a link ≠ Λ.
         LDA   0,2         T4. Compare. rA ← KEY(Q).
         CMPA  K
         JE    SUCCESS     Exit successfully if rA = K.
FAILURE  EQU   *           Exit if not in the trie.
         ENTA  0
         HLT
SUCCESS  ENTA  0,2
         HLT
         END   START
